        <name>ISOTP_TX_BUFFER_SIZE</name>
        <initializer>4095U</initializer>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Largest message one link can transmit, in bytes. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>The link copies the message into a buffer of this size, so the caller may reuse its own buffer as soon as <ref refid="group__isotp__link_1ga2883f7405a37500b850b7d45b0367d51" kindref="member">isotp_link_send</ref> returns. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
