    <briefdescription>
<para>Build-time configuration for ISOTP-C. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Every parameter can be overridden by the integrator with a compiler definition (for example <computeroutput>-DISOTP_RX_BUFFER_SIZE=64U</computeroutput>) without editing this file. The buffer sizes are compiled into <ref refid="group__isotp__link" kindref="compound">Link</ref>, so they set the RAM footprint of one link. The protocol defaults are only the values written by <ref refid="group__isotp__link_1gadd4f1f0a9fde1d1b8d2f344bdc4381b8" kindref="member">isotp_link_config_default</ref>; every link can use its own values at run time.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="par"><title>Configuration elements in this group:</title><para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><ref refid="group__isotp__config_1ga1e9ef1192205306071d1c947546d9882" kindref="member">ISOTP_TX_BUFFER_SIZE</ref>, <ref refid="group__isotp__config_1gaadb42a273414ec0f18e94c8d1a51394e" kindref="member">ISOTP_RX_BUFFER_SIZE</ref> : largest message in each direction. </para>
</listitem>
<listitem><para><ref refid="group__isotp__config_1ga1a714bbf6b5053ee3163bc73dfc9555d" kindref="member">ISOTP_DEFAULT_BLOCK_SIZE</ref>, <ref refid="group__isotp__config_1ga16db8b5370cd0d9b5f15357f97486d4b" kindref="member">ISOTP_DEFAULT_ST_MIN_US</ref> : flow control we request. </para>
</listitem>
<listitem><para><ref refid="group__isotp__config_1gaa472f989c3be95bbf2105513d2b28ace" kindref="member">ISOTP_DEFAULT_N_BS_TIMEOUT_US</ref>, <ref refid="group__isotp__config_1ga90a8e2482c7ecefdc27aec57a6722a12" kindref="member">ISOTP_DEFAULT_N_CR_TIMEOUT_US</ref> : timeouts. </para>
</listitem>
<listitem><para><ref refid="group__isotp__config_1ga95933a9dc7f9da6a7d08c5fb390534c2" kindref="member">ISOTP_DEFAULT_WFT_MAX</ref> : flow-control wait frames we accept. </para>
</listitem>
</itemizedlist>
</para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
